  <main id="main" tabindex="-1">
    <section class="hero wrap" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> In development · Android &amp; Windows</p>
        <h1 id="hero-title">RACE THE LINE.<br><span>BUILD THE TRACK.</span></h1>
        <p class="hero-intro">Overhead racing, five-lap time trials and a track editor.</p>
        <p class="muted">Learn a circuit, find a faster line and share the tracks you create. Race locally or take your best times online.</p>
        <a class="button primary" href="#game">Explore the game <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
      </div>
      <figure class="hero-art">
        <a href="/site/blind-spot-race-endurance-v1.webp" aria-label="View the Blind Spot gameplay screenshot at full size"><img src="/site/blind-spot-race-endurance-v1.webp" alt="Overhead gameplay on Blind Spot featuring an orange Rally car with a custom livery" width="1280" height="720" fetchpriority="high"></a>
        <figcaption><span>ACTUAL GAMEPLAY</span><span>Blind Spot · development build</span></figcaption>
      </figure>
    </section>

    <div class="quick-facts wrap" aria-label="At a glance">
      <p><strong>FIVE-LAP RACES</strong><span>Find a faster route around each circuit.</span></p>
      <p><strong>TRACK EDITOR</strong><span>Build, test and share your own layouts.</span></p>
      <p><strong>PLAY YOUR WAY</strong><span>Race offline or compete online.</span></p>
    </div>

    <section id="game" class="section wrap" aria-labelledby="race-title">
      <div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">01 / Race</p><h2 id="race-title">Learn the circuit.<br>Improve your time.</h2><p>Read the road from above. Learn the braking points, feel the grip and find the line that brings it all together.</p></div>
      <div class="race-layout">
        <figure class="screen"><a href="/site/blind-spot-race-rally-v1.webp" aria-label="View another Blind Spot gameplay screenshot at full size"><img src="/site/blind-spot-race-rally-v1.webp" alt="Racing on Blind Spot in a teal and cream Rally car with a custom livery" width="1280" height="720" loading="lazy"></a><figcaption>Actual game screen · Blind Spot</figcaption></figure>
        <div class="mode-list">
          <article><span class="number" aria-hidden="true">01</span><div><h3>Free Race</h3><p>Pick a circuit and chase your personal best over five laps. Restart and try again whenever you like.</p></div></article>
          <article><span class="number" aria-hidden="true">02</span><div><h3>Weekly Rivalry</h3><p>Take on a weekly selection of tracks with drivers of similar pace. Your best verified results count.</p></div></article>
          <article><span class="number" aria-hidden="true">03</span><div><h3>Challenges</h3><p>Set a time and share an invitation for a one-to-one or group challenge on the same track and car.</p></div></article>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="section-note">Local racing works without an online account. Online competitions and sharing need sign-in, an internet connection and an available game service.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="worlds" aria-labelledby="worlds-title">
      <div class="wrap worlds-inner"><div><p class="eyebrow">A change of scenery</p><h2 id="worlds-title">Five biomes.<br>Pick your setting.</h2><p>Choose Grass, Desert, Night, Winter or Storm when you create a track.</p></div><figure class="screen"><a href="/site/create-biomes-20261031.webp" aria-label="View the Create biome selection screen at full size"><img src="/site/create-biomes-20261031.webp" alt="The game's Create screen showing the Grass, Desert, Night, Winter and Storm biome choices" width="1280" height="720" loading="lazy"></a><figcaption>Actual game screen · Select biome</figcaption></figure></div>
    </section>

    <section id="create" class="section wrap split-section" aria-labelledby="create-title">
      <div class="feature-copy"><p class="eyebrow">02 / Create</p><h2 id="create-title">Build a circuit.<br><span>Then race it.</span></h2><p>Lay out roads, shape the surroundings and place the start line. Go from an idea to a circuit you can actually drive.</p><ul class="feature-list"><li>Combine straights, curves, hairpins and bridges.</li><li>Choose surfaces and add trackside objects.</li><li>Test your layout in untimed practice.</li><li>Keep local drafts or publish a validated track for others.</li></ul></div>
      <figure class="screen"><a href="/site/blind-spot-editor-v1.webp" aria-label="View Blind Spot in the track editor at full size"><img src="/site/blind-spot-editor-v1.webp" alt="The track editor showing the Blind Spot circuit and its editing tools" width="1280" height="720" loading="lazy"></a><figcaption>Actual game screen · Blind Spot in the track creator</figcaption></figure>
    </section>

    <section id="garage" class="section wrap split-section garage-section" aria-labelledby="garage-title">
      <figure class="screen"><a href="/site/garage-current-20261031.webp" aria-label="View the current Garage screenshot at full size"><img src="/site/garage-current-20261031.webp" alt="The current Garage showing a customised Rally car and the vehicle carousel" width="1280" height="720" loading="lazy"></a><figcaption>Actual game screen · Garage</figcaption></figure>
      <div class="feature-copy"><p class="eyebrow">03 / Garage</p><h2 id="garage-title">Choose a car.<br><span>Make it yours.</span></h2><p>Explore six vehicles with distinct handling, from the agile Rally to the Kart, Volt, Hover and rear-steering Forklift.</p><p>Try paint, patterns, stickers and cosmetic parts in the Garage. Take a parking-hall test drive, or wash off the dirt from your last outing.</p><p class="small muted">Cosmetic options can require unlocks. Previewing a look does not purchase it.</p></div>
    </section>

    <section id="account" class="account-section" aria-labelledby="account-title">
      <div class="wrap account-inner">
        <div><p class="eyebrow">Your account &amp; privacy</p><h2 id="account-title">Account<br>and privacy.</h2><p>Read how your information is handled, or request deletion of your Beat my track online account here, even if you have uninstalled the game.</p><p>Verify with the Google identity you used in the game, review what you will lose and choose whether to confirm. Your Google account stays.</p><div class="account-actions"><a class="button secondary" href="/account-deletion">Delete game account <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="/privacy">Read the privacy policy <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div>
        <div class="account-details"><h3>Before you decide</h3><p>Deletion permanently removes your online account and remaining online benefits, including paid benefits.</p><p>Local tracks and local car customisation stay on your device. Published tracks and historical standings remain under “Removed account”.</p><p>The deletion page explains retained records and shows your remaining benefits before you confirm.</p><a class="text-link" href="/community-rules">Community rules <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="availability wrap" aria-labelledby="availability-title">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Development status</p><h2 id="availability-title">Coming to Android<br>and Windows.</h2></div>
      <p>Beat my track is in development. Release and playtest details will be shared when they are available.</p>
    </section>
